  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smart Farming - (eDIAL) - Bill and Melinda Gates Foundation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smart farming and data ecosystems (grants to be identified jointly with BMGF)

Grants that promote climate resilient smart farming technologies and practices for smallholder farmers. These projects would also focus on building data ecosystems to inform smart farming activities, for example real time and geographically precise weather and soil data. BMGF will lead on identifying grant opportunities which will then be reviewed by DFID and BMGF, with a strict focus on interventions that align with overall DFS portfolio objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
